<br>
["Heh, it's good that //someone// still cares about my education. But I think it'll be a better use of both our time if I actually make some progress first before I talk about it."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
    "<!--A-->\"Sure. Action first, words later.\"", "actionFirst",
    "<!--B-->\"Not trying to pressure you. Just checking up, that's all.\"", "justChecking",
))
<br>


